      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Four semi-trucks in a giant toy stadium,256real bouncing balls. ACTION
    extends/retracts your actual telescoping scoop. A ball must physically enter
    its mouth while extended; there is no distant pickup radius. Up to6balls fit
    in the visible rear cargo hopper. Collection earns NO points. Drive to your own
    colored collection bin and slow below4m/s to deposit. Only deposited normal/golden
    balls score1/5points, once. Black fuse balls explode, scatter your carried cargo
    and give a bounded physical knockback. A meaningful rival ram can also knock
    loose half your load; deposited balls are secured. AI uses the same real scoop,
    capacity, driving, hazard and deposit rules. The round ends when every valuable
    ball is banked or time expires. Highest score wins; equal scores share placing.
    Default three minutes,2/5minute options. Shared/chase/full cab, Your Crew, horn,
    weather, optional AI views, independent controls, recorded highlights and rematches
    use collection systems.
